    "details": "Mailpit author reports:\n\n> The cross-site WebSocket hijacking fix was reimplemented as an origin\n> check gated on a raw-URI prefix test, but Go\\'s ServeMux routes on the\n> percent-decoded path, so requesting /%61pi/events reaches the\n> WebSocket handler while skipping the only origin control, and the\n> upgrader itself accepts every origin.\n",
    "id": "FreeBSD-2026-0356",
